<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 139,400 MT exceeded the previous week by 63 percent and the 4-week average by 37 percent.  The major increases were for unknown destinations (45,000 MT), the Philippines (32,000 MT), Egypt (20,200 MT), and Canada (16,700 MT).  Exports of 79,700 MT were 44 percent less than the previous week and the 4-week average.  Italy (20,700 MT), Egypt (20,200 MT), Guatemala (14,400 MT), and Canada (10,700 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
